  "body": "<!-- This is a bug report template. By following the instructions below and\r\nfilling out the sections with your information, you will help the us to get all\r\nthe necessary data to fix your issue.\r\n\r\nYou can also preview your report before submitting it. You may remove sections\r\nthat aren't relevant to your particular case.\r\n\r\nText between <!-- and --​> marks will be invisible in the report.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nAccounts which are created after invitation are periodically kicking out of the room\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1) Have a room and invite user which have not yet matrix account (by email)\r\n2) When new account is created you can see that he accepted invitation before he do it manually\r\n3) The user accepts the invitation and enters the room. He can read and wirte posts but he is kicked out within tens of minutes (I don't know it exactly, but it happens certainly within an hour)\r\n4) Step three happens repeatedly (It's very bad for getting new users)\r\nIt's realy bad for getting new users, I'm afraid. :-/\r\n\r\nIt's realy bad for getting new users, I'm afraid. :-/\r\n\r\nI have already tried to find a solution, but unsuccessfully. I tried:\r\n- reject invitation, create new one and accept it\r\n- kick off user (when looks be a member) and rejoin\r\n\r\nLogs being sent: no\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Linux 4.13.12/Fedora 28**: Mozilla Firefox 66.0.4\r\n- room and accounts are at riot.im server",
